          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "TO FLOAT2\n\nThe To Float2 node converts floats and integers to the float 2 type. \nIt will use the incoming value for both components of the float2.\n\nFor example:  A float(5.3) into the To Float2 node will produce a float2(5.3, 5.3).\n\nWire will almost always implicitly convert to float2 for you, making this node very niche."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 221.09188842773438,
          "width": 512.9530029296875,
