          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "EXAMPLE: MOVING A CIRCLE OVER X/Y\n\nIn this example we convert the signal from the Saw node(float) to the float2 type using the To Float2 node.\nPlease note that this conversion is not necessary, Saw into Move would do this for you."
